==Battleground==
*3 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Project A]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage has very little threat. Remember to bring Breakerblast for Le'Solar if none of your units can break its Barrier outright.

